{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2023-01-26 17:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, JAN. 26, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE: PH),\xa0THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.33 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF FEBRUARY 10, 2023. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE MARCH 3, 2023.'}